<title>UK: CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warwickshire beat</p>
<p>Sussex by 105 run in their NatWest Trophy semifinal match at</p>
<p>Edgbaston on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores:  Warwickshire 342-3, 60 overs innings closed. Sussex</p>
<p>237 in 53.1 overs (M.Newell 79; A.Donald 5-37).</p>
<p>Warickshire will play Essex in the final at Lord's on</p>
<p>September 6.</p>
</text>
